{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a87624ee5f64b96d7244ba177583f588d88a2f2863c2111f8ae936b7cce883cd", "ja": "（今日の響の仕事は、ファッションショー。\nもうすぐ、リハーサルの時間だが……）", "zh": "（响今天的工作是时装秀。\n马上就要到排练的时间了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "feb254b8466efeb417d8583f6a19b7408451d5c479724a1a679de7d3d6b98375", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}。ステージを\n歩く時、自分、ちょっとだけダンスしてみてもいい？", "zh": "问你喔，{$P$}。上台走秀的时候，\n本人可以稍微加点舞蹈动作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "90059cee526bd604b43435f26cda150aad183fb4708c6a9ffb54293b7bf6e092", "ja": "ダンス？　どうだろうな。\nスタッフの人達に聞いてみるけど、ただ……。", "zh": "舞蹈？我也不清楚，\n我会去帮你问问工作人员，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "23dc052b1e06d04869f4de819c2222516d99ab1fa870ad3f55c3d91849ebe9b3", "ja": "ファッションショーだから、主役は服だよね。\n自分、それはわかってるつもりだぞ。", "zh": "这是时装秀，衣服才是主角对吧。\n本人很清楚这点喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "fb561f8c3f32bf3a88e3fab6cc928f615fa34677e4d282f20dd5cc871fd58e2b", "ja": "でも、あの服ってカッコイイけど、カワイイでしょ？\nスカートも、けっこう広がるし……だから、えっと～。", "zh": "可是，那件衣服不只很帅，又很可爱不是吗？\n裙摆也很飞扬……所以，那个～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1005_p", "source_sha256": "afff2056d73cee193716c52206f802c5adce9868279e1cd422c5df65b26413e2", "ja": "……そうか。響がちゃんと考えての事なら、\nデザイナーさんや演出さんと、相談してみようか。", "zh": "……这样啊，既然响不是随口说说，\n我就去跟设计师和秀场导演商量看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "3f90c412a7c7cdcb425827cfb368789ed1e678c9629ed5e27311350b3e37a93f", "ja": "えっ、いいの！？\nありがと、{$P$}！", "zh": "咦？可以吗！？\n谢谢，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1007_p", "source_sha256": "aa6baa9e506ca642bce009e72f30498a39cc4174f22a3dfc35ca878eddc5e2c2", "ja": "よかったな、響。本番でのダンス、OKもらえて。", "zh": "太好了，响。获得同意在正式登台时加入舞蹈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "9093747f186e0414ac3ac40f121d82470de973bc0b3a8e7a0daecb447acf3170", "ja": "うん！　これも{$P$}が、\n説明手伝ってくれたおかげだね！", "zh": "嗯！这也都要感谢{$P$}\n帮忙本人说明！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1009_p", "source_sha256": "39766760d8b921998cfc094a2695178e815eb056fe5bd51bde0c9f1045a11e2a", "ja": "俺の説明より、響のダンスが決め手だったけどな。\n躍動感で服がより一層、映えていたよ。", "zh": "真正说服大家的不是我的说明，是响的舞蹈才对。\n你的跃动感让服装显得更加亮眼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "379bc5eed50d93f6e9a0281c7b62c7bd231e33dcd10fff20b4f164231ce6ed32", "ja": "そ、そうかな？　えへへ～。\nそんなにホメても、何も出ないけど……。", "zh": "是、是吗～？嘿嘿……\n你这样夸本人，也不会有什么奖赏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "7b6a1c5b3692c7da849939e69a0ede4ab16aa9caa6b3fa7818bba780242a97bb", "ja": "あっ、でもダンスならいっぱい出せるぞっ。\nとっておきのステップ、楽しみにしててよね！", "zh": "啊，但本人可以展现很多舞蹈喔！\n好好期待本人珍藏的舞步吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0043_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d3d1174d5d798e47190c700fa2306ad8656c9297e93f5adbd640b55960b76415", "ja": "（どうやら響は、服の魅力を最大限引き出しそうだ。\n俺も負けずに、響の魅力を引き出さないとな！）", "zh": "（看来响可以展现出服装最大的魅力。\n我也不能输，得把响的魅力激发出来才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
